---
source: tests/proxy_golden.rs
description: "The same Anthropic text reply converts to the same Gemini parts, finishReason and usage in stream and non-stream mode."
---
# stream
<no-event-name> {"candidates":[{"content":{"role":"model","parts":[{"text":"Hi"}]},"index":0}],"usageMetadata":{"promptTokenCount":9,"candidatesTokenCount":1,"totalTokenCount":10},"modelVersion":"claude-sonnet-4-5","responseId":"msg_g1"}
<no-event-name> {"candidates":[{"content":{"role":"model","parts":[{"text":" there"}]},"index":0,"finishReason":"STOP"}],"usageMetadata":{"promptTokenCount":9,"candidatesTokenCount":4,"totalTokenCount":13},"modelVersion":"claude-sonnet-4-5","responseId":"msg_g1"}

